            "categoryTitle": "Ministries and Societies",
            "introtext": "\t<p>Call the Parish Office for more information:  <a href=\"tel:5167314220\">516-731-4220</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"button\" href=\"ministries-societies/ministry-schedules\">Ministry Schedule</a></p>",
